Thu Nov 12 21:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Add moxfm-modern-defaults.patch, modernizing the default
  configuration copied to ~/.moxfm:
  * Replace programs that no longer exist: NEdit as editor,
    xterm+less as viewer, Firefox for HTML, XImaging for JPEG, PNG,
    TIFF, PNM and Sun raster images, ImageMagick display for GIF,
    gv for PostScript, mupdf for PDF, mtpaint for XPM, mpv for
    video; drop FrameMaker and xmailtool
  * Use the freedesktop trash (gio trash, monitored at
    ~/.local/share/Trash/files); fix the Trash button that pointed
    at /root/.trash
  * Drop the floppy and CD-ROM entries (usermount and the fixed
    mount points are gone); moxfmdev explains how to add devices
  * magic: recognize Exif JPEG, PNG, PDF and lower-case or
    doctype HTML
- Require glib2-tools and xterm; suggest gv, mupdf, nedit and
  ximaging

