Thu Nov 12 19:00:00 UTC 2026 - caiocco <caiocco@yahoo.com.br>

- Initial package of moxfm 1.0.1+git20260915.e81d6c2 from Thomas
  Adam's repository
  * Build with imake, %optflags and the distribution linker flags
  * Add moxfm-install-destdir.patch: the top-level install rule
    wrote the data files outside DESTDIR
  * Add moxfm-xft-fonts.patch: render all text with Xft (Sans and
    Monospace, set per rendition tag in the app-defaults) instead of
    the Adobe 75dpi core fonts; keep CDE's global *Font resource
    from turning the Xft renditions back into core fonts
  * Install the data files (copied to ~/.moxfm on first start) and
    pixmaps into /usr/share/moxfm
  * Install the sample checkmail script into /usr/libexec/moxfm
  * Add a desktop entry and icon
